# Getting started

You can contribute to Tau Ceti just by running:

```
uv tool install git+https://github.com/TauCetiProject/TauCetiWorker
tauceti work --loop
```

You'll need `uv` and `gh` installed, `gh` authenticated with GitHub, and either
Codex or Claude Code installed and authenticated.

[Worker setup and documentation →](https://github.com/TauCetiProject/TauCetiWorker#readme)
